#: ../../library/pyb.LED.rst:75
msgid ""
"Get or set the LED intensity.  Intensity ranges between 0 (off) and 255 "
"(full on). If no argument is given, return the LED intensity. If an argument"
" is given, set the LED intensity and return ``None``."
msgstr ""
"Dapatkan atau atur intensitas LED. Intensitas berkisar antara 0 (mati) "
"hingga 255 (menyala penuh). Jika tidak ada argumen yang diberikan, "
"kembalikan intensitas LED. Jika argumen diberikan, atur intensitas LED dan "
"kembalikan ``None``\\ ."

#: ../../library/pyb.LED.rst:79
msgid ""
"*Note:* Only LED(3) and LED(4) can have a smoothly varying intensity, and "
"they use timer PWM to implement it.  LED(3) uses Timer(2) and LED(4) uses "
"Timer(3).  These timers are only configured for PWM if the intensity of the "
"relevant LED is set to a value between 1 and 254.  Otherwise the timers are "
"free for general purpose use."
msgstr ""
"*Catatan:* Hanya LED(3) dan LED(4) yang dapat memiliki intensitas yang "
"berubah secara halus, dan mereka menggunakan timer PWM untuk "
"mengimplementasikannya. LED(3) menggunakan Timer(2) dan LED(4) menggunakan "
"Timer(3). Timer-timer ini hanya dikonfigurasi untuk PWM jika intensitas LED "
"yang relevan diatur ke nilai antara 1 dan 254. Jika tidak, timer tersebut "
"bebas untuk penggunaan tujuan umum."

#: ../../library/pyb.LED.rst:87
msgid "Drive the LED to its on state."
msgstr "Gerakkan LED ke kondisi menyala."

#: ../../library/pyb.LED.rst:91
msgid "Drive the LED to its off state."
msgstr "Gerakkan LED ke kondisi mati."

#: ../../library/pyb.LED.rst:95
msgid ""
"Flip the LED's current state. If it was on it goes off, and vice versa. "
"Useful for heartbeat blinkers in a polled loop or timer callback."
msgstr ""
"Balik kondisi LED saat ini. Jika sebelumnya menyala maka akan mati, dan "
"sebaliknya. Berguna untuk blinker heartbeat dalam loop polling atau callback"
" timer."
